## Case: nb18s-shadowed-var
id: "ace.m1.ia920.nb18s"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

````auto
fn main() int {
    let x int = 1
    if true {
        var x int = 5
        x = 6
        print(x)
    }
    return x
}
````

### VM result
check-id: "autovm"
final-newline: false

```text
6
```
